    "name": "PragnyX CA Firm Management API",
    "description": "Postman collection mapped to the PragnyX MERN assignment. Start the Express API and MongoDB first. Register a client and seed an administrator using private environment variables. Set preferredDate to a future YYYY-MM-DD date and selectedService to an active service name. Do not use the test database or sample passwords for production. All requests include expected HTTP status assertions and can be executed with Newman in sequence. API host and port are configurable using apiHost and apiPort collection variables.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
